echo 새 객체는 Eden에 bump 할당된다. 크기가 홀수여도 다음 객체는 정렬되어 있어야 한다
gen_create 4K 4K 64K 3
gen_alloc a 1 8
expect space a eden
expect age a 0
expect aligned a
expect eden_used > 0
gen_alloc b 0 13
gen_alloc c 0 8
expect zeroed c
expect aligned b
expect aligned c
expect differ a b
expect differ b c
write a AAAAAAAA
write b BBBBBBBBBBBBB
write c CCCCCCCC
expect data a AAAAAAAA
expect data b BBBBBBBBBBBBB
expect data c CCCCCCCC
expect survivor_used == 0
expect old_objects == 0
